  "content": {
    "_uid": "60387de3-f3f4-bbe9-5d39-b2737de67e06",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "571ba09c-de88-84f0-3972-3df7b92c1cf4",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Dr Gilani joined AKU in 1986 as a senior instructor and rose to become a professor of pharmacology in 1997. He has a wide range of research interests and has made breakthrough discoveries in the area of natural products pharmacology. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "While commenting on the motivations for his research, Dr Gilani said: \"There is a need to explore our indigenous resources and to develop a system where traditional and modern physicians can work together for better healthcare of non-affording patients, who comprise the majority of our country's population.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
